"P2631125341" "Temperature Protection gives you strong resistance to Fire damage, and some resistance to Cold damage as well.  This power is always on and costs no Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Plasma Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
