"P3753683648" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P498129335" "You can clap your hands together to release a violent Lightning Clap. The Lightning Clap can knock down most nearby foes, Disorienting many of them. Lightning Clap deals no damage. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Rod 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
