"P250923752" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing and Lethal attacks and increase his Resistance to Fire and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3084486850" "You now have greater Defense to Smashing and Lethal attacks and have greater Damage Resistance to Cold and Fire damage."

