"P2645153605" "Glacial Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2080418632" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Energy, Negative), Res(Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P632958510" "Envelopes an ally in gleaming Glacial Ice. Its crystalline structure has refracting properties that grants the target good Defense against Energy and Negative Energy attacks.  Glacial Shield also grants the target some damage resistance to Cold. You cannot stack multiple Glacial Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Ice Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2479112040" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Energy and Negative Energy attacks and increase his Resistance to Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P147881231" "You now have greater Defense to Energy and Negative Energy attacks and have greater Damage Resistance to Cold damage."

