"P736381502" "Frostwork"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2319784263" "Target +Max HP, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P274192473" "Covers an ally in a thick layer of Frost. The frost can absorb the impact from enemy attacks, effectively increasing your ally's maximum Hit Points for a short time. Frostwork also grants your ally resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P959662280" "Your {PowerName} increases the maximum Hit Points or {PlayerDest} and grants him some resistance to Toxic damage."
