// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3234644764" "Stealth, +DEF,  +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Slow)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4211426561" "The Arctic Fog is making you more difficult to detect.  This increases your Defense and gives you some resistance to Fire, Cold, Energy and Slow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Benumb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1487719916" "Benumb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2863146898" "Ranged Foe -DMG, -END, -Regeneration, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P988082907" "Numbs a single target to its very core.  Benumb reduces the target's core body temperature, dramatically weakening him.  A Benumbed target's Damage and Regeneration Rate are greatly reduced.  Additionally, the affected target's secondary power effects are all weakened. The target's powers' effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3420705000" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1696097231" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P888300159" "-DMG, -Regeneration, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P838811387" "Your Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects have all been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sleet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3382651313" "Sleet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1355298513" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DoT(Cold), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -DEF -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3712729563" "Summons a Sleet Storm at a targeted location. Sleet deals minimal Cold damage to anything that passes through the storm. It also Slows the affected foes and severely reduces their Defense and resistance to damage. Many foes may even slip and fall trying to escape the storm. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3124605688" "DoT(Cold), -DMG, -Res, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2628796128" "The Fog is causing cold damage to you and has reduced your damage potential, resistance, attack rate and running speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heat Loss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P950820295" "Heat Loss"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P754231800" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -RES, -END, Slow; Team +END, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2236440889" "Heat Loss drains the heat from your enemies and transfers that energy to your allies in the form of Endurance. All foes near the selected target may experience a Heat Loss, which will drain their Endurance, Slow them, and reduce their Damage Resistance.  Each enemy target that is successfully drained of Heat will expel that energy to all your nearby allies, granting them Endurance and a boost to their Endurance Recovery. Some Endurance and Recovery will also be transferred directly to you and any allies near you. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dark Miasma 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3077952552" "Dark Miasma"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1388544255" "Focus the dark power of the Netherworld to weaken your foes.  Dark Miasma focuses on draining your opponent."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Twilight Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4164717180" "Twilight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3586101894" "Ranged, Foe -Acc -DMG, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1955851383" "You channel Negative Energy from the Netherworld through yourself to a targeted foe. Twilight Grasp drains the power from that target and slowly transfers it to you and all nearby allies. The targeted foe's Accuracy and damage are reduced, while you and your nearby allies are healed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2067398773" "-ACC, -DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4209463532" "The Twilight Grasp has reduced your Accuracy and Damage potential."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tar Patch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1281699562" "Tar Patch"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2412290026" "Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Res, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2097823509" "Drops a large patch of viscous Negative Energy which dramatically slows down enemies that run through it and reduces their damage resistance. Affected targets stuck in the Tar Patch cannot jump or fly. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2018496806" "-SPD, -Res, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2237864073" "Your Running speed and damage resistance is reduced by the Tar Patch.  You cannot jump or fly away while in the Tar Patch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Darkest Night 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1936194933" "Darkest Night"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3498857783" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3614863801" "While active, you channel Negative Energy onto a targeted foe. Darkest Night decreases the damage potential and Accuracy of the target, and all foes nearby, as long as you keep the power active. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3721856918" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P881382177" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage with his {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P721444675" "Your Accuracy and Damage potential are reduced by the darkness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Howling Twilight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3229109842" "Howling Twilight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2786507797" "Ranged (AoE), Minor DMG(Negative), Target Slow, -Recharge, Disorient, Ally Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P1291713129" "Activating this power channels the power of the Netherworld to weaken your foes, in an attempt to revive all nearby fallen allies. You must stand near your defeated allies to revive them, then select a foe. The selected foe and all nearby foes will be Slowed, Disoriented, and drained of some life. Revived allies will have full Hit Points and Endurance and will be protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2058899669" "Your {PowerName} reduced {PlayerDest} attack rate and movement speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2669148710" "-Recharge, -SPD, Disorient"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P181463503" "You have been Disoriented.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced by the Howling Twilight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2272064692" "Shadow Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4241292887" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear)"
// Power Help Text :
"P890111217" "Envelops you and your nearby teammates in a shroud of darkness. Shadow Fall does not grant Invisibility, but it does make you harder to detect. Even if you are discovered, Shadow Fall grants a bonus to Defense bonus to all attacks and Resistance to Fear, while reducing Energy, Negative Energy, and Psionic Damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type power while using Shadow Fall. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1493333783" "You are hidden within the Shadow Fall."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2430370769" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear))"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2614214872" "Shadow Fall has made you difficult to detect, which increases your Defense.  Shadowfall also partially absorbs and deflects Energy, Negative Energy and Psionic damage. You are also less fearful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fearsome Stare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2548525324" "Fearsome Stare"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4131316570" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Fear, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P4269315290" "Instills tremendous Fear within a cone area in front of you, causing all affected targets to tremble in Terror uncontrollably. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2158732075" "The Fearsome Stare has terrified you and reduced your Accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Petrifying Gaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P799801114" "Petrifying Gaze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P778647036" "Ranged Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2575616074" "Petrifies a single targeted foe with a terrifying gaze. The victim is Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2901818041" "Your {Powername} Holds {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1063217015" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Petrifying Gaze."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4121526834" "The Petrifying Gaze has stopped you in your tracks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Black Hole 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P801416744" "Black Hole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P36099885" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P140060975" "Opens up a Black Hole to the Netherworld that temporarily pulls in all foes within its grasp. The victims become phase shifted and are completely intangible. They are hard to see, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4032697821" "Intangible"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2861448899" "You have been sucked into a Black Hole.  You cannot affect or be affected by anyone in your vicinity."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1325279438" "You pull {PlayerDest} into another dimension.  He is now intangible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Servant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1851218085" "Dark Servant"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2290037222" "Summon Dark Servant: Ranged Debuff Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P771199714" "Summons a Dark Servant to your aid. The Dark Servant possesses an assortment of dark powers to weaken your foes. The summoned entity is not a willing servant, and it is only your power that binds it in this realm.  The Dark Servant can be buffed and healed. Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Kinetics 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1213219189" "Kinetics"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1630872074" "You are a master at manipulating and transferring Kinetic energy. You can manipulate the potential energy found in objects to aid your allies or weaken your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Transfusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2614747173" "Transfusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3141505437" "Ranged, Foe -End, -Regen, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3363453526" "Transfusion drains an enemy of some Endurance and reduces the target's Regeneration rate, and transfers that energy, in the form of Hit Points, to all allies near the affected foe. You can use Transfusion to heal yourself as well as your allies. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P977901485" "-Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2832674077" "Your Regeneration rate has been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1943804202" "Siphon Power"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1215489231" "Ranged, Foe -DMG, Team +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3314880552" "You can Siphon the Power from a targeted foe, reducing his damage potential. The power is transferred back to you, increasing your own damage potential and that of all nearby allies. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2850056344" "-DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2043380143" "Your damage potential has been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2155263558" "Repel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2287014103" "Toggle: Self AoE Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P782172935" "Repel creates a zone of kinetic energy that violently repels nearby foes. Each foe that is repelled costs additional Endurance. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1461880598" "You protect yourself with your {PowerName}, and will knock down any foe that approaches you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4013495699" "Your {PowerName} temporary disables a power in use by {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Speed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3614500476" "Siphon Speed"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3067560929" "Ranged, Foe -Speed, Self +Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P4118447933" "You can Siphon the speed from a targeted foe, Slowing his movement and attack rate while boosting your own. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4194632176" "Your Running Speed potential has been altered.  If this is a friendly power, your Running Speed in increased.  If you were attacked with this power, though, your Running Speed is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Increase Density 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3687435012" "Increase Density"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1601178268" "Ranged, Ally Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3904011659" "Increases an ally's mass, freeing him from any Disorient, Immobilization, or Hold effects and leaving him resistant to such effects for a while. Increase Density also protects the target from Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as Smashing and Energy damage. Because the target grows more dense, his movement speed is Slowed. Although the Damage Resistance and slowing effect will not stack with multiple applications, the rest of the effects of Increase Density will. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1924523378" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3719467599" "{PlayerSource} protect you from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel, and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1228522254" ""+Res(Special)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1912899325" "Your Resistance to Smashing and Energy attacks has been increased.  You are more resistant to Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleport attacks, but your movement rates are slightly reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Speed Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3686758356" "Speed Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P146937202" "Ranged, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P553862191" "You can hasten a single targeted ally. The target's movement speed, attack rate, and Endurance recovery are all greatly increased and the target gains resistance to Slow effects. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P922167688" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1810162801" "You've been granted a Speed Boost.  Your Attack speed, Endurance recovery and Running speed are all increased and you are resistant to Slow effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inertial Reduction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4081596977" "Inertial Reduction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810722637" "PBAoE, Allies +Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P2315677234" "You can reduce your Inertia, along with that of all nearby allies. The affected allies can then jump incredible distances for a while. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1459003196" "+Jump"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2340966442" "Your inertia has been reduced, allowing you to make incredible leaps."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Transference 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1682568980" "Transference"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3030858431" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Target -End, Team +Recovery, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2850383216" "Transference drains an enemy of some of his Endurance and transfers that Endurance to all allies near the affected foe. You can use Transference to recover Endurance for yourself as well as your allies. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P496142339" "-Endurance"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1231917684" "Your Endurance has been drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fulcrum Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3140221556" "Fulcrum Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3575358054" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -DMG, Team +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3127032294" "Fulcrum Shift drains the power of a targeted foe and all foes nearby, transferring it to all adjacent allies, you, and those near you. Affected foes will deal less damage, while your affected allies will deal more. The more foes that are affected, the more power you and your allies receive. Fulcrum Shift can dramatically turn the tide of a battle. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3883900150" "Radiation Emission"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2059255153" "Radiation Emission powers allow you to manipulate atomic particles and waves to protect your allies and weaken your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiant Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3533172966" "Radiant Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P336745852" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P972381749" "You can use Radiant Aura to heal some of your wounds, and the wounds of your group. This power has a small radius, so your allies need to be near you if they wish to be affected. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1645239844" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4291132995" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Infection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3091774412" "Radiation Infection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P219045603" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DEF, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P2212272484" "Infects a targeted foe with deadly radiation, severely reducing his Accuracy and Defense. All foes that come near the target will also become infected. The Radiation Infection will last until you deactivate it, or until the original target is defeated. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2574572377" "Your {PowerName} weakens all nearby foes."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P987711590" "-DEF, -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4119226925" "The Radiation Infection has reduced your Defense and Accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Accelerate Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P275167913" "Accelerate Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1511657802" "PBAoE, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam +Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1089850112" "Activating this power emits radiation that increases the running speed, attack speed, Endurance recovery, and damage potential of all nearby allies. Affected allies' metabolisms are increased so much that they become resistant to effects such as Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1550301107" "You begin to accelerate your metabolism, and the metabolism of all nearby allies."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2942153168" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam, +Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2897583752" "Your metabolism has been boosted.  Your movement speed and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  Lastly, you are resistant to Sleep, Mez, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enervating Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082274496" "Enervating Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2214322243" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3687495261" "While this power is active, you irradiate a targeted foe, and all foes nearby, with a deadly dose of radiation. This radiation weakens exposed targets, decreasing the damage of their attacks.  It also significantly weakens their resistance, so they will take much more damage from other attacks. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2100668018" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage potential of all nearby foes."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3022714566" "-DMG, -Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3774123069" "Your Damage potential and Resistances have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3057588896" "Mutation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2944072660" "Close, Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2424811839" "Using a concentrated burst of radiation, you can revive a fallen ally and Mutate him into a killing machine. The Mutated target has increased damage, Accuracy, Endurance recovery, and attack speed and is protected from XP Debt fort 90 seconds. The entire experience is very taxing on your ally, and he will soon be severely weakened. All effects of the Mutation will eventually wear off. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P285856014" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect and Mutate you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1832549363" "Mutated"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3683627659" "Your have been mutated.  Your Accuracy and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of this mutation wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4053506418" "You Mutate {PlayerDest} and heal him for {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P927448213" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage. For a while, you are Mutated beyond belief and have increased strength, but this will burn out fast, and you will be weakened in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3161843313" "Your accelerated Mutation has worn off, and you are now weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lingering Radiation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3321233827" "Lingering Radiation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4020505167" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P1417733947" "You can emit Lingering Radiation that reduces the attack rate, movement speed, and Regeneration rate of the target, and all nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3060559231" "Your {PowerName} Slows all nearby foes."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P319543156" "-SPD, -Recharge, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3611700118" "Your Attack rate, Running speed, and Regeneration rate have been reduced by the Lingering Radiation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Choking Cloud 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2196045966" "Choking Cloud"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1228973208" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2718652843" "While active, you generate toxic radioactive gas around yourself. Any nearby foes may be overcome by the gas, leaving them choking and helpless. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P835496752" "You are caught in a Choking Cloud."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fallout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P310781374" "Fallout"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P884719996" "Post-Defeat: PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe -ACC, -DEF, -DMG, -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3831120936" "After an ally falls in battle, you can activate this power to extract the energy from their body to deal a massive amount of Energy damage to any nearby foes. All affected foes are extremely weakened by the Fallout, and their Accuracy, Defense, Damage and Damage Resistance is severely reduced.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EM Pulse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P987369644" "EM Pulse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3111590990" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, -END, -Regen, Special vs. Robots; Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P1230835890" "You can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns.  It will drain the Endurance, and HP Regeneration of all affected targets and leave them incapacitate and Held for a long while. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P799513638" "Hold, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3632529316" "You are Held by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2753580196" "Your {PowerName} Disorients and Immobilizes {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102804825" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} of some Endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2665432657" "Your {PowerName} has left you exhausted!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Sonic Resonance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P565143336" "Sonic Resonance"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2998248482" "You have the ability to control sound in several fashions.  You can create semi-solid barriers, set up waves which weaken or strengthen a target, as well as creating soothing sounds which act to counteract any negative effects which may exist on your friends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P460333435" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken his Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Barrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3785736125" "Sonic Barrier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2639635747" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P369890919" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2959881722" "You protect {PlayerDest} from physical attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3976820757" "{PlayerSource} protects you from physical attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3556417710" "+Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P961837590" "The Sonic Barrier has increased your resistances to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Haven 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
