// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clarity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3612462228" "Clarity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P607744490" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confusion), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P292921568" "By bouncing a carefully pitched sound wave off an ally's ear drum, you can free him from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects, and leave him resistant to such effects for a good while. Protection will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Clarity also provides your ally's enhanced perception. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3942129800" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and improve his Perception."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2019260028" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and improves your perception."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1474485343" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2940769611" "The soothing waves of sound clear your mind of all Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and improves your perception."

