"P3987837546" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe Knockback, Hold, -ACC, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1976624521" "You unleash a barrage of sonic waves on the Earth itself, generating a powerful, localized earthquake. Most foes that pass through the location will fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their Accuracy and Defense. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3657845567" "DoT(Smashing), -ACC, -DEF"
