"P391065281" "Ranged (Cone), Extreme DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3887214533" "Spews forth a cone of flames from underneath the barrel of your assault rifle, setting foes on fire. Very accurate and very deadly at medium range. Damage: Extreme(DoT) Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P106624625" "The Flamethrower has set you on fire and you are burning."
