"P1620482472" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P34011997" "Sprays a targeted location with accelerant from your flamethrower, igniting the location. Any foes that pass through the flames will be burned. Great for blocking doorways and small passages. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
