// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1260850157" "Casts a rock hard Ice Shield on one of your allies and grant him Defense to Lethal, Smashing and Fire attacks and damage resistance to Cold and Fire damage. You cannot stack multiple Ice Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Glacial Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself.  Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glacial Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4270155197" "Envelope an ally in gleaming Glacial Ice. Its crystalline structure has refracting properties that grants the target good Defense against Energy and Negative Energy attacks.  Glacial Shield also grants the target some damage resistance to Cold. You cannot stack multiple Glacial Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Ice Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frostwork 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P183553588" "Self Heal, +Max HP, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1044359696" "Covers an ally in a thick layer of Frost. The frost can absorb the impact from enemy attacks, effectively increasing your ally's maximum Hit Points for a short time. Hoarfrost also grants your ally resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Arctic Fog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3981819137" "Your mastery of Cold allows you to hide yourself and all nearby allies within thick Arctic Air. Arctic Air makes you and your allies harder to see and increases your Defense to melee and ranged attacks, as well as your resistance to Slow, Fire, Cold, and Energy damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type powers while using Steamy Mist.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3561330929" "The Arctic Air is making you more difficult to detect.  This increases your Defense and gives you some resistance to Fire, Cold, Energy and Slow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Benumb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P494796958" "Ranged Foe -DMG, -END, -Recovery, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4261802786" "Numbs a single target to its very core.  Benumb reduces the targets core body temperature, dramatically weakening him.  A Benumbed targets damage and Regeneration Rate are greatly reduced.  Additionally, the affected targets the secondary power effects are all weakened. The targets powers effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4271834757" "-DMG, -END, -Recovery, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :

