// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heat Loss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1851842740" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -END, Team +END, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2469805504" "Heat Loss drains the heat from your enemies and transfers that energy to your allies in the form of Endurance.  When you select an enemy target, all foes near that target may experience a Heat Loss.  Each enemy target that is successfully drained of Heat will expel that energy to all your nearby allies, granting them Endurance and a boost to their Endurance Recovery. Some Endurance and Recovery will also be transferred directly to you and any allies near you. Recharge: Long"

