// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P278080781" "Increases an ally's mass, freeing him from any Disorient, Immobilization, or Hold effects and leaving him resistant to such effects for a while. Increase Density also protects the target from Knockback, as well as Smashing and Energy damage. Because the target grows more dense, his movement speed is Slowed. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1475265480" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Immobilization, and Disorient effects, as well as smashing and energy damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P46798297" "{PlayerSource} protect you from Immobilization, and Disorient effects, as well as smashing and energy damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P324926545" "Your Resistance to Smashing and Energy attacks has been increased.  You are more resistant to Hold, Disorient and Immobilize attacks, but your movement rates are slightly reduced."

