// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Barrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2545197852" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Haven 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3172507461" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Fire, Cold, Energy, and Negative Energy attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Havens on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Barrier. You cannot use this power on yourself.. Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

