// Power Help Text :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clarity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3603311956" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Terrorize, Confusion)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3856782840" "By bouncing a carefully pitched sound wave off an ally's ear drum, you can free him from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Terrorize, or Immobilize effects, and leave him resistant to such effects for a good while. Protection will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Clarity also provides your ally enhanced perception. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2280165024" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3663883721" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep and Immobilize effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3754563099" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1264341518" "The soothing waves of sound clear your mind of all ill effects and protect you for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Repulsion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
