// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P796483470" "Ranged, High DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P169967525" "You can open a gravitational rift and retrieve a heavy object, then Propel it at your foes for Smashing Damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2053203920" "You levitate something handy and Propel it at {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
