// Power : Dimension Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3572177719" "Dimension Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3728867518" "Your mastery of gravity allows you to manipulate dimensions, bringing multiple foes out of sync with reality. Your foes become completely intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2953255080" "You have been shifted into an alternate dimension.  You powers cannot effect anyone but yourself, but you cannot be harmed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
