"P3577978297" "Gravity Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3095732666" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P919459034" "Creates a large, intensely misshapen Gravity Distortion Field that encompasses several foes, rendering them unable to take any action. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P169853037" "You are being held in a Gravity Distortion Field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
