// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P704570369" "Wormhole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4052788000" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Teleport, Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1807841529" "You can open a gravitational Wormhole behind a targeted foe and violently push him, and all nearby foes, through it. The victims are sent flying out the other end of the Wormhole and are left Disoriented. You determine the location of the Wormhole's end, and can place it high in the air if desired. More powerful foes may be resistant to the Wormhole effects. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Singularity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1747473765" "Singularity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1654473077" "Summon Singularity: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3199467779" "You can create a very powerful Gravitational Singularity.  The Singularity will engage your foes, assaulting them with various gravity powers.  Any foes that attempt to approach the Singularity will be violently hurled away.  The Singularity cannot be healed, but is highly resistant to all forms of damage and nearly impervious to Controlling type powers.  Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ice Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2899985889" "Ice Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4141548241" "You can draw moisture from the air to create Icy formations. With these abilities, you can control ice with remarkable precision to dominate your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilblain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2787247941" "Chilblain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1689686328" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1117927853" "Immobilizes your target in an icy trap, dealing some Cold damage over time as well as slightly slowing the target's attack and movement speed. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1003436427" "DoT(Cold), Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
