// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2732056965" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Cold), Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1375030455" "You can freeze a single foe in a Block of Ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be held, but all affected targets will be Slowed and take some Cold damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2267104667" "Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1196691141" "You are frozen in a Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2491454990" "You freeze {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
