"P4182514592" "Frostbite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P529425902" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P4260003263" "Immobilizes a group of foes in icy traps. Deals minimal Cold damage over time and slightly Slows the targets. Slower and less damaging than Chilblain, but can capture multiple targets. More resilient foes may only be Slowed. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2071838229" "The Frostbite is causing damage over time to you, and is holding you immobile.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are also reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Arctic Air 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P550725603" "Arctic Air"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3441487566" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Confuse(Special), -SPD, -Recharge, -Stealth"
// Power Help Text :
"P3167774931" "While this power is active, you are surrounded in a fog of Arctic Air that dramatically slows the attack and movement speed of nearby foes.  The chill of Arctic Air is so bitter that many foes are forced to flee, albeit very slowly, from the immediate area. Others may attack their own allies, as the fog from the Arctic Air is thick and can cause much confusion.  The cold air can also reduce the stealth capability of affected foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P247137831" "You are hidden within the Arctic Air."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1153392305" "Confuse, -SPD, -Recharge, -Stealth"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1027505645" "The Arctic Air has reduced your Running speed and Attack rate. The cold air has reduced your stealth capability and you are periodically confused, and may attack an incorrect target with your powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shiver 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P575259887" "Shiver"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3242282090" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3925256144" "You can blast forth a wide cone of chilling air that dramatically Slows the movement and attack rate of nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P706922686" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P115947258" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with his {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3117558399" "You are shivering.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Slick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3381390693" "Ice Slick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3469263350" "Target (Location AoE), Foe Knockdown, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P3129487594" "You can create a large patch of ice at a targeted area, causing all foes that pass through it to lose their footing. Those caught in the Ice Slick are dramatically slowed and tend to fall down. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3605848267" "-SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P902485759" "The Ice Slick has reduced your Running speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Freeze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P889361091" "Flash Freeze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1242338930" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Cold/Lethal), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P574642158" "You can Flash Freeze a large patch of ground beneath a targeted foe, instantly forming dozens of deadly ice shards that do Cold damage to all enemies in the area. The victims are left trapped within the icicles, but can break free if disturbed. Only targets near the ground can be affected. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1543480825" "You have been frozen and cannot act."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1059044119" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2221891402" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of cold damage to {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glacier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P263201509" "Glacier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1181465507" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P4181586144" "You can freeze all foes around yourself in blocks of Glacial ice. The targets are frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. Even after the victims emerge, they remain chilled and their attack and movement speed is Slowed for a while. This power can only be cast near the ground. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2891143059" "You are frozen in a Glacier.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jack Frost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4144432762" "Jack Frost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P631689004" "Summon Jack Frost: Melee Moderate DMG(Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1900360772" "You can create a very powerful entity of animated ice at a targeted location. Jack Frost possesses several ice powers to attack any nearby foes and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mind Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1985844312" "Mind Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3661840123" "You can manipulate and control your opponent's mind. Since Mental powers directly affect the mind, most tend to be very accurate, and thus very useful against higher level foes. Few foes can resist Psionic powers, but creatures without minds, like machines and robots, are resistant to many of the effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mesmerize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P132115517" "Mesmerize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3745657044" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3150892177" "Mesmerize painfully assails a target with psychic energy, rendering him unconscious. The target will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2909147384" "You have been Mesmerized and cannot act."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1271393123" "Your {PowerName} enraptures {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3484838227" "{PlayerSource} enraptures you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage with his {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Levitate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1342451600" "Levitate"
// Power Help Text :
"P3537293895" "You can send a single target violently into the air, then slam him to the ground for Smashing damage. This power can bring flying foes to the ground. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1848917007" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} and drop him to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dominate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
