"P1898196680" "Dominate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P237929186" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2698584595" "Painfully tears at the mind of a single foe. Dominate deals Psionic damage and renders a foe helpless, lost in his own mind and unable to defend himself. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2697171271" "You have been Dominated."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3628030904" "You Dominate {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P310874651" "{PlayerSource} Dominates you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confuse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1116895679" "Confuse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3576454646" "Ranged, Target Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P3264723238" "You can Confuse an enemy, forcing him to believe his friends are not who they appear to be. If successful, the enemy will ignore you and attack his own allies. If you Confuse someone before he has noticed you, your presence will continue to be masked. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by a Confused enemy. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2584848323" "You have been confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Hypnosis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1476679299" "Mass Hypnosis"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3125035697" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P1818379305" "Hypnotizes a group of foes at a distance and puts them to Sleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. This power deals no damage, but if done discreetly, the targets will never be aware of your presence. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2694554816" "You have been Hypnotized and cannot act."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Telekinesis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P289841888" "Telekinesis"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P488012662" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold, Repel"
// Power Help Text :
"P2076298011" "Lifts a foe, and any nearby foes, off the ground and repels them.  The targets are helpless, unable to take action, and will continue to hover away, picking up any passing targets, as long as you keep this power active. Keeping up this level of concentration costs a lot of Endurance. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4182303717" "You move {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1128839865" "{PlayerSource} uses {PowerName} to control you."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3373051975" "You are being telekinetically held in place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Domination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1372864868" "Total Domination"
// Power Help Text :
"P3555659293" "Tears at the mind of a target foe and those near him. Total Domination renders all affected foes helpless, lost in their own minds and unable to defend themselves. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Terrify 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P227779229" "Terrify"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2936611653" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Psionic), Foe Fear(Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P985566626" "This power Terrifies foes within a cone area in front of you, causing them to tremble in Fear uncontrollably. The effect is so frightening and overwhelming, that the target takes real damage from the physiological response to this Psionic attack. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2416579000" "You have been terrified."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P948391865" "{PlayerDest} is Terrified and takes {Damage} points of Psionic damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P35236857" "{PlayerSource} Terrifies you.  Your fear consumes you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P603284719" "Mass Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2684033640" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P3196844745" "You can cause Mass Confusion within a group of foes, creating chaos. All affected foes within the area will turn and attack each other, ignoring all your allies. If you Confuse your foes before they noticed you, your presence will continue to go unnoticed. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4213198885" "You are confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Plant Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2665551719" "Plant Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2200191133" "You can call forth and control the power of plants and flora to control your foes. Animate and control vines, roots and spores to entrap, entwine and utterly dominate your foes.  Many Plant Control powers are only effective if the target is near the ground."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2311510427" "Entangle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1977928016" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P758686855" "Immobilizes your target by Entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny roots.  The roots do smashing and lethal damage to the target over time. More resilient foes may require multiple applications to Immobilize. Entangle can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P96007827" "Immobilize, DoT(Smashing, Lethal), -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1307118483" "The roots have Entangled you, crushing and cutting you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1017785955" "Your roots Entangle and crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3255310503" "{PlayerSource} Entangles you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1778679471" "Thorns from your roots Entangle and cut {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P853782236" "Thorns from the roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Strangler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1512853674" "Strangler"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3361538192" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2121824688" "Holds a distant foe by Strangling him with massive root-like vines. The target is held helpless, while he is slowly crushed by the vines. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1388205829" "Hold, DoT(Smashing)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1317566367" "The Strangler Vine is crushing you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3798610094" "Your Strangler Vines crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2383523282" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with Strangler Vines for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Roots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P643865738" "Roots"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1693257692" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3338619209" "Immobilizes a group of foes by entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny Roots.  Roots is slower and does less damage than Entangle, but it can capture multiple foes in one attack. Like Entangle, Roots can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3912708265" "The Roots have entangled you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2050263094" "Your roots entangle and crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3511610119" "{PlayerSource} Roots you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P815848887" "Your Roots entangle and cut {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1781923097" "The roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spore Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3049408788" "Spore Burst"
// Power Help Text :
"P1869576980" "You hurl a large fungi pod at your foes.  This pod is full of Spores that burst on impact, engulfing the target and all those around him.  All affected targets may succumb to the narcotic effect of the Spores and will fall asleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3852064002" "The Spore Burst has rendered you unconscious!  Any damage will awaken you, however."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeds of Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P822704386" "Seeds of Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P233247000" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P2412309615" "You throw a handful of seeds from a rare Baffle plant at your foes.  The seeds spread out in a wide cone and release a dusty chaff that contain a number of alkaloids and hallucinogenic compounds.  Foes that come into contact with these seeds become violently confused and will turn and attack each other, ignoring you and all your allies. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Tree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P456354136" "Spirit Tree"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2260217477" "Place Tree: PBAoE Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3540830848" "You can tap into the elusive and powerful energy of the World Tree and extract a Spirit Tree at a targeted location. The Sprit Tree is immobile, but possesses incredible regenerative powers. The Regeneration Rate of you, or your allies, will be greatly increased as long as you are near the Spirit Tree.  Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2760912049" "Vines"
// Power Help Text :
"P267223508" "Creates a field of Strangler Vines that can Hold multiple foes at range. The affected targets are held helpless by the massive root-like vines. Unlike the power Strangler, this power does not deal any damage, but it can Hold multiple foes at once. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1778180013" "The Vines are Holding you and preventing you from acting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Carrion Creepers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3728825099" "Carrion Creepers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1677778155" "Summon Creepers, Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Fly, -Jump,"
// Power Help Text :
"P2565561919" "You can create a Creeper patch at a targeted location.  The patch will snag foes, slowing their movement, and preventing them from jumping or flying. Additionally, a Creeper Vine will burst from under each live and defeated foe in the area and start attacking your enemies. Creeper Vines do minimal damage, but they can knock down your enemies and its poisonous thorns can slow your foes. Any foes that are defeated in the Creeper patch will also produce a growth of Entangle Roots that will Immobilize any enemies near the defeated foe. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fly Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P349392526" "Fly Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3041632272" "Summon Fly Trap: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P785516111" "You can summon a giant carnivorous Fly Trap plant beast.  Fly Trap may be an understatement, as this plant beast has a taste for flesh.  The Fly Trap will viciously attack any nearby foes; biting, hurling poisonous Thorns and even casting its own Entangle Roots. The Fly Trap will fight by your side and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"

