// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2006157955" "Force Field"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2535089454" "The Force Field powers give you the ability to create shells of energy that protect yourself and your allies from various forms of damage and harm.  Force Fields do not reduce damage, but reduce your allies chance of getting hit in the first place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3532762553" "Force Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1949322042" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1133545432" "Discharges a bolt of force that knocks down foes and deals some Smashing Damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1494496101" "Your {PowerName} temporarily disables a power in use by {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Deflection Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1823934049" "Deflection Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1152404173" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1966278961" "Dramatically protects an ally from Smashing, Lethal and all Melee attacks for a limited time.  Also reduces Toxic damage. You cannot stack multiple Deflection Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Insulation Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P737094794" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks, as well as Toxic Damage, with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2660225500" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks with a {PowerName} and grants you some resistance to Toxic damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2240545096" "+DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P639359596" "You have been encased in a Deflection Shield.  Your Defense to Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks is increased, and your ability to resist Toxic attacks is increased as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Insulation Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4034787409" "Insulation Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3550036896" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative, Ranged, AoE), Res (End Drain)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1302168924" "Dramatically protects an ally from Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy, Ranged and AoE attacks for a limited time. The Insulation also protects the target from Endurance Draining effects. You cannot stack multiple Insulation Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Deflection Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1217548023" "You protect {PlayerDest} from fire, cold, energy, negative energy, ranged and AoE attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2372394357" "{PlayerSource} protects you from fire, cold, energy, negative energy, ranged and AoE attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P346136420" "+DEF(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative, Ranged, AoE)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3977068540" "The Insulation Shield is improving your Defense to Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy, Ranged and AoE attacks. The Insulation Shield also protects you from Endurance Draining effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Detention Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3517858636" "Detention Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P466648448" "Encases a targeted foe in a Detention Force Field. The captured target cannot be harmed, is Immobilized, and cannot attack or aid his allies. The target can, however, use powers on himself. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3938244390" "You have been captured in a Detention Field.  You cannot be harmed, however, you can only use powers which affect yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3850683110" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2723592640" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of any attacks that do get through. The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3782792257" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks, but you can only cast powers on yourself while the Force Field is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dispersion Bubble 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3137523235" "Dispersion Bubble"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2876428248" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team +Res(Hold, Immobilize, Disorient) +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1398218065" "Creates a large bubble which protects all allies inside. While active, the Dispersion Bubble gives all allies within increased Defense against all attack types. The Dispersion Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1309444121" "You protect {PlayerDest} from all damage types with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2704196223" "{PlayerSource} protects you from all damage types with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3780623979" "+Res(Hold, Immobilize, Disorient) +DEF(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1240327833" "The Dispersion Bubble is increasing your Defenses to all attacks and providing protection from Hold, Immobilize and Disorienting attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repulsion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3240570147" "Repulsion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2358627271" "Toggle: PBAoE Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4196026139" "This Toggle power creates a field that violently repels nearby foes. Each foe that is repelled costs you additional Endurance. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repulsion Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3990140054" "Repulsion Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P844134779" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Knockback, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3301989297" "Projects an expanding Force Bubble around an ally that knocks down and Disorients nearby foes. This power cannot be used on yourself. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2989352291" "You protect {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3758674313" "{PlayerSource} protects you with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Bubble 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4195196004" "Force Bubble"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2016297432" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe Repel, Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P628908370" "Creates a large bubble which protects all allies inside. While active, this power keeps all foes at bay, protecting all allies inside from melee or short ranged attacks. More powerful foes may be able to penetrate the Force Bubble, buy may slip and get knocked down and forced back if they try. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P947844219" "Your {PowerName} keeps your foes at bay."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4275575935" "Poison"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2841584505" "You are a master of Poison and can concoct a variety of venoms and toxins allowing you to weaken your enemies.  When used correctly, some Poisons can even be used to aid your allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alkaloid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3338218470" "Alkaloid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P192217088" "Ally Heal, +Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P633752156" "When used correctly, poisons can be used to heal, as well as harm.  Alkaloid consists of just the right amount of amino acids to safely heal a single targeted ally. The healed target is also left with some resistance to Toxic Damage (This Toxic Damage Resistance cannot be Enhanced). You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1946890476" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage and improve his resistance to Toxic Damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P711986937" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and improves you resistance to Toxic Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Envenom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1357149555" "Envenom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3090154177" "Ranged Foe -RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P4163182912" "You Envenom your foe with a nasty poison.  The toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected targets Defense, Damage Resistance and Hit Point Regeneration Rate.  The poison is so potent, that the target actually responds less to Healing while affected by the poison. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P584376124" "You Envenom {PlayerDest} and reduced his Defense and Damage Resistance and Regeneration."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4071568468" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense, Damage Resistance and Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1511201118" "-RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3705153969" "Your Defense, Damage Resistances and Regeneration have been reduced.  You also Heal less from Heal powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Weaken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2214790859" "Weaken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1260038621" "Ranged Foe -DMG -ACC, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2080165961" "You poison a single foe with a venom that significantly Weakens their strength.  The affected targets Accuracy and Damage output is severely reduced. Additionally, the affected targets secondary power effects are all weakened. The targets power effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P671237190" "You Weaken {PlayerDest} and reduced his Accuracy, Damage and power effects."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1924342686" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Accuracy Damage and power effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2731614901" "-ACC, -DMG, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2973211110" "Your Accuracy and Damage potential and power effects have all been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neurotoxic Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1837006782" "Neurotoxic Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P413475405" "You can breath a cone of Neurotoxin gas that quickly start to anesthetize any nearby foes.  Affected targets may choke on the gas as their movement and attack rate are severely reduced. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3697806060" "You are choking on Neurotoxic gas.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elixir of Life 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2164945405" "Elixir of Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2337327276" "With this Elixir, you can revive a fallen ally and turn him into a killing machine. The revived target has increased damage, Accuracy, Endurance recovery, and attack speed, and gains a resistance to Toxic damage. A brew of this sort is not without its side effects. The revived target will soon become very sick and severely weak after about 90 seconds. All effects of the Elixir will eventually wear off. Elixir of Life can only be used on Players and cannot be used on your Henchmen.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P2987816183" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2170799907" "Your have been saved by the Elixir of Life.  Your Accuracy and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well and you gain a resistance to Toxic damage.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of the Elixir wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P145195147" "You give {PlayerDest} your Elixir of Life and revive him for {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P759634541" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage with an Elixir of Life. For a while, the Elixir has increased strength, but it will wares off fast, and you will be become sick and weak in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3379169905" "Your Elixir has worn off, and you are now sick and weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Antidote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729372453" "Antidote"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3742989655" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3475282986" "This Antidote can free an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Slow and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. The Antidote also grants the target some resistance to Cold and Toxic damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1821941840" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and Toxic Damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P987519504" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and improves your resistance to Toxic Damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3366835073" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Slow, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4196796945" "The Antidote has granted you temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and your resistance to Toxic Damage is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralytic Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2127894003" "Paralytic Poison"
// Power Help Text :
"P4045211070" "This Paralytic Poison viciously attacks a foe's nervous system and can leave an affected target completely Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3786662314" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Paralytic Poison."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3285550051" "The Paralytic Poison has left you completely Held and defenseless!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1053931898" "Place Trap: PBAoE Foe Sleep, -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P4123618746" "You can build a Poison Trap on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Poison Trap will cause it to detonate and release its toxic vapors. The poison is a knock-out gas, and any foes in the affected area may be drained of much of their Endurance and quickly put it to Sleep. The trap is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trap will detonate. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Noxious Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3018093279" "Noxious Gas"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P838597520" "Ranged (Infect Henchman); Foe -RES, -DEF, -ACC, -Res, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P853247783" "You can infect one of your Henchmen, surrounding him with a Noxious Gas.  All foes near the infected Henchmen will be overcome with the Noxious Gas.  Their Defense, Accuracy, Damage and Damage resistance will all be reduced.  Additionally, there is a chance than any affected humanoid enemy will become violently ill.  Even the mightiest foe will stop dead in their tracks, and left helpless as he empties the contents of his stomach. Recharge: Very Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1402300901" "You Empower {PlayerDest}."

