// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Field Generator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1221351809" "You can build a Force Field Generator Drone.  It will generate a Dispersion Bubble that gives all nearby allies increased Defense against all attacks including Psionic. The Dispersion Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. The Drone will follow you, can be buffed and healed or even destroyed.  However, it is not a Henchman and cannot be given commands. Limited to one Force Field Generator.  Recharge: Very Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeker Drones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P174470245" "You creates two Seeker Drones. These Seeker Drones will follow you until they detect an enemy and then they will zero in on their targets and detonate on impact. The small explosive flash of energy does only minor damage, but the concussion can weaken foes.  Affected targets will have reduced Damage, Accuracy and Perception and may even be Disoriented for a short while.  You can only ever have Two Seeker Drones out at one time and they can be destroyed by your foes. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Trip Mine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Detonator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3069665139" "Detonator"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3381808143" "Sacrifice Henchman, PBAoE, Extreme DAM(Lethal/Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3337714167" "A good Mastermind means always plans ahead, but a great one knows when to make a strategic sacrifice.  You have equipped all your Henchmen with explosives.  When the time is right, select a Henchman and set off the Detonator. Undead and Robots are easily rigged and will blow up instantly, devastating nearby enemies.  Ninjas, Soldiers and other free thinking Henchmen will try to place the explosive on the ground and get away.  But you know... the fuse is short.  Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Trick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2922508614" "Trick Arrow"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4162466956" "Trick Arrows are tipped with an odd variety of payloads, which if used strategically, can dramatically alter a battle site."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangling Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3890749173" "Entangling Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2341099947" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P739830885" "Upon impact, the Entangling Arrow releases a strong net that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking. The Entangling Arrow can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Entangle Arrow has a fairly low Endurance cost and a bonus to its Accuracy. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4105081437" "Immobilize, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3737381867" "You have been caught in a net.  You cannot move or fly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2538058937" "Flash Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3148009533" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Visibility, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P602363786" "This arrow explodes in a dazzling flash of light and sound. The targets are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most foes will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the foes are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to Accuracy. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1714495609" "-Visibility, -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P878294227" "The flash of light has left you dazzled.  Your accuracy and range of sight are greatly diminished."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glue Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3237857720" "Glue Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P766338561" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1943557615" "This arrow carries a cartridge of intensely sticky glue, which explodes on impact. The glue Slows the movement and attack rates of any foes in the area. Damage: Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3416938233" "Ice Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3906379218" "This arrow can freeze a single foe in a block of ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be Held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Gas Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2744262583" "Poison Gas Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P125124087" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3155999525" "This arrow carries a capsule cloud of poisonous gas, which explodes on impact and weakens all foes in its vicinity. Affected foes damage potential will be severely reduced. Some foes will react badly to the poison and choke for a time, though they will react if attacked.  Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Acid Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2671335934" "Acid Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1594890146" "Ranged (AoE) Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1804268649" "This arrow explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as his Damage Resistance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3256323102" "Your {PowerName} splashes acid on {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P472308012" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an Acid Arrow.  The acid is burning you and reducing your damage resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2396833550" "-Res(All), -DEF, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1207406105" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Acid Arrow."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P254720165" "You take {Damage} points of Toxic Damage from the Acid Mortar."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruption Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P697171009" "Disruption Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1774769806" "Ranged (Location AoE), -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P548914281" "This arrow plants a sonic resonator at a target location. The vibrations of the resonator weaken the Damage Resistance of all nearby foes. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1489999320" "The Disruption Arrow has lowered your Resistances."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3873393603" "Your {PowerName} reduces the resistances of {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Oil Slick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P851023681" "Oil Slick Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2794896108" "Ranged (Location AoE), Knockdown, -Speed, -DEF, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3872456209" "On impact, this arrow creates an oil slick that Slows foes in the area and may cause them to slip and fall. The oil slick is very flammable and may burst into flames if fire is used near it.  Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P175414405" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2063198606" "This arrow can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy on impact. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns. It will incapacitate all foes in its radius. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3357512105" "You are held immobile by the EMP Pulse, and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4082949565" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with his {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

