// Display Name :
"P2240630470" "Golden Dragonfly"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2993209467" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockback, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1046595430" "You perform a devastating Golden Dragonfly attack that deals a massive amount of damage and can even knock a foe down to the ground and reduce it's Defense. The power of this attack can actually extend a short distance through multiple foes. If executed while hidden, only some affected targets may be hit with a Critical, however, there is a chance you may land a Critical hit with Head Splitter even if you are not Hidden.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blinding Powder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P521479399" "Blinding Powder"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2694447000" "-ACC, Sleep, Confuse,  -Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P871228088" "Your have been blinded.  You are helpless and confused."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P78341141" "Hide"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3567599116" "Toggle: Self Stealth, +DEF(Melee, Ranged, AoE)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3405300257" "The very essence of what makes a Stalker.  Hide allows you to blend into your environment, making you almost impossible to detect. When properly 'Hidden", a Stalker can pull off Critical hits with his attacks, and even land a massive 'Assassins Strike' with an Assassins power. When you attack or are damaged while using this power, you will be discovered. Even if discovered, you are hard to see and retain some bonus to Defense. Unlike most stealth powers, Hide can be used at the same time as other Concealment related powers, giving you even greater stealth capability.  Very low Endurance cost."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Costume1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P504555551" "This Jounin has been Enlightened. He can now execute a Golden Dragonfly.  He can also Hide and use Blinding Powder."

