"P2540810008" "Your {PowerName} devastates {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3167872531" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

