// Power : Auto Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2023029757" "Auto Turret"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P645443609" "Build Turret: Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3039517493" "You can place a stationary Auto Turret on the ground. The Auto Turret has an extremely fast fire rate and is equipped with a customized tracking system. Once locked on, the Turret will continue to unload a volley of lead into the target until it is destroyed or is out of range. The Turret is armored, but can be destroyed. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
