// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brute_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1724566754" "Soul Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P174162448" "Ghost Widow has granted you access to the power of darkness and souls. This has granted you access to powers and abilities you have never had before."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
