// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3945604315" "Soul Tentacles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1122427135" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3828501134" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows the souls of the damned to slip into our reality. These Soul Tentacles will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while they drain their life. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4031354083" "The Soul Tentacles are immobilizing you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Obliteration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P663035305" "Dark Obliteration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3373707877" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(NEgative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3377894206" "You hurl a large blast of negative energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must have Gloom or Soul Tentacles before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Blood Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P696474747" "Summon Blood Widow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P320003152" "Summon Blood Widow: Melee Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P768306896" "Ghost Widow has assigned a beautiful but deadly Blood Widow assassins for you to command. Their weapons of choice include wrist retractable mounted razors and darts, all tipped in deadly poison. Your access to this Blood Widow's aid is very limited, and you can only summon her once an hour, however, she will  fight by your side until defeated, or until you leave a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Stalker_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
