// Power : Dark Obliteration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3401573784" "You hurl a large blast of negative energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must have Dark Consumption or Dark Embrace before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Fortunata Seer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2825430988" "Summon Fortunata Seer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P525223622" "Summon Fortunata Seer: Ranged Moderate DMG(Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4242966167" "Ghost Widow has assigned a Fortunata Seer for you to command.  Fortunata Seers can glimpse moments into the future. They use this ability to increase the Perception of their teammate. Your access to this Fortunata Seer's aid is very limited, and you can only summon her once an hour, however, she will  fight by your side until defeated, or until you leave a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

