"P2710481403" "Shadow Dweller"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2826338089" "Auto: Self +DEF(All), +Res(Immobilize), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P1165855925" "You are a true Shadow Dweller of the Netherworld.  Your affinity for the shadows grants you an inherent bonus to all Defense, as well as an increased Perception and a resistance to Immobilization.  Your Perception bonus and resistance to Immobilization improves over level.  Shadow Dweller is an Auto power.  It is always on and costs no Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Obsidian Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3474611385" "You can create a special Obsidian Shield that grants good resistance to Psionic damage. With your mind enshrouded in darkness you are protected from Sleep, Fear, Hold, Immobilize and Disorient attacks. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :

