// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninjitsu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2546782405" "Ninjitsu"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1848136070" "Ninjitsu is the secret art of Ninja.  Many Ninjitsu powers emphasize acute senses that allow you to react deftly to avoid danger. Others focus on the ability to hide in plain sight.  Still others rely on the ancient art of Kuji Kiri, and the pure focus of the mind to accomplish the impossible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ninja Reflexes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3595433736" "Ninja Reflexes"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2645954271" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Melee), Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1723704579" "Activating your Ninja Reflexes enables you to be more evasive to melee attacks. This will increase your Defense versus melee as long as it is active. Ninja Reflexes also grants you resistance to Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P493374246" "Your Ninja Reflexes allow you to avoid melee attacks."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Danger Sense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3260963519" "Danger Sense"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2437793024" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Ranged, AoE), +Perception, Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2014726068" "You become more evasive against ranged and area attacks while you have Danger Sense activated. This will increase your Defense versus ranged and Area of Effect attacks as long as it is active. Your Danger Sense also allow you to perceive stealthy foes and resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2707102790" "Your Danger Sense allows you to easily avoid ranged attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Caltrops 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2332631327" "You toss a handful of Caltrops at a targeted location and spread the tiny metal spikes over a large area. Any enemy that passes over the Caltrops will be forced to move at a slower rate. They will also take some trivial Lethal damage over time. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Rin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4184330932" "Kuji-In Rin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2775742065" "Self +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4081989519" "Kuji-In Rin is the strength of mind and body.  By focusing your power on this exercise, you gain a resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilization, Confusion, and fear, as well as resistance to Psionic damage for a few minutes. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1416335400" "You are now highly resistant to Disorient, Immobilize, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear and Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Sha 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1895928915" "Kuji-In Sha"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810685749" "Self Heal, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3469865187" "Kuji-In Sha invokes the power of Sha, or healing. Focusing your inner power, you can heal your body of its wounds and leave yourself resistant to the effects of Toxic damage for a while. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1504742341" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and you are now resistant to Toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smoke Flash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P120571169" "PBAoE, Foe Placate"
// Power Help Text :
"P1845630287" "You throw a smoke bomb at your feet.  The resulting flash of light and smoke can briefly distract your foes and Placate them so they can no longer find or target you. Combined with Hide, Smoke Flash is the perfect distraction to get out of a bad situation. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P254088221" "You Placate {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2512466921" "The {PowerName} Placates you and you cannot target {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blinding Powder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1575892457" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -ACC, Sleep, Confuse, -Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2241791308" "You throw a handful of Blinding powder in a wide arc at your foes. Most foes will be blinded, and unable to see. Some affected targets may be overcome by the powder that they may start attacking their own allies. If you attack the blinded foes, they will be alerted to your presence, but will continue to suffer a penalty to Accuracy. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Retsu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3602318660" "Kuji-In Retsu"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3479477082" "Self +DEF, + SPD, +Recovery, Res(DeBuff DEF), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P544106076" "Kuji-In Retsu is the mastery of space and time. Focusing your power on Retsu enables you to control your own time to easily defeat your foes. Mastery of this power enables you to avoid almost any attack, be it ranged, melee, or area effect. Your running speed, jumping height and Endurance Recovery are also increased. Retsu also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs. When Retsu wears off, you are left drained of all Endurance and unable to Recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3331472993" "You are now extremely Elusive, and almost impossible to hit."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Regeneration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3132767435" "Regeneration"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2495269693" "Regeneration leads to powers that let you regenerate more quickly from damage and effects. Regeneration offers almost no actual damage resistance, but your Hit Point Regeneration can become so incredibly fast, that your wounds heal almost instantly.  Those who possess this power set have little downtime."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fast Healing 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3913785951" "Fast Healing"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3584220347" "Auto: Self +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P916349593" "You heal Hit Points at a faster rate than normal. This power is always on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Reconstruction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2739289019" "Reconstruction"
// Power Help Text :
"P4226034962" "Through perfect control of your body, you can concentrate for a few moments and heal yourself. The effects of Reconstruction also leaves you resistant to Toxic damage for a while. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P454249131" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} hit points!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dull Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P323254828" "Self +Max HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1599872563" "Using ancient techniques, you can make yourself more resilient to pain. Thus, you can take more damage before being defeated. When you activate this power you will increase your maximum Hit Points for a couple of minutes. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Integration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2071323212" "Integration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4038107139" "Toggle: Self +Res(Knockback, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize), +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P4247017977" "You can Integrate your mind and body, making you resistant to Knockback, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilization effects, as well as increase your regeneration rate, for as long as you can keep this toggle power active. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1336694971" "You are now highly resistant to Disorient, Immobilize, Hold, Sleep and Knockback."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Resilience 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2730750744" "Resilience"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P496051534" "Auto: Self +Res(Disorient, Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P112263729" "You are more Resilient. This power allows you to build up a resistance to Disorientation effects. You tend not to get Disoriented, and if you do, it wears off quickly. This resistance to Disorientation gets stronger as you go up in level. Resilience also grants some resistance to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage. This power is always on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Instant Healing 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2482136037" "Instant Healing"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P181672001" "Click: Self +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P995967917" "When you activate this power, you can regenerate your health at an astounding rate. This boost to you Regeneration Rate lasts about a minute and takes a long time to recharge once used. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2198838236" "You activate {PowerName} and start to Regenerate at an astonishing rate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Revive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3971593258" "Revive"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1762744290" "Self Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P3483092885" "Should you fall in battle, you can Revive yourself from the brink of death. You will revive with most of your Hit Points and half your Endurance and be protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1697561617" "You {PowerName} yourself from the brink of death.  You feel weak and cannot do anything for a while."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P345555159" "+XP Debt Protection"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P46542041" "You have Revived yourself. You are protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Moment of Glory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3083458275" "Moment of Glory"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2446050132" "Self +Res(All DMG but Psionics), +DEF(All DMG but Psionics), +Recovery, -HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P139947053" "When you activate this power, you lose almost all of your Hit Points and can no longer Regenerate Hit Points, However, you gain Resistant and Defense to all damage types except Psionics, recover Endurance more quickly, and are highly resistant to Sleep, Disorient, Immobilization, and Hold effects. After Moment of Glory wares off, you will not be able to Regenerate Hit Points for a short while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3602074806" "You lose most of your Hit Points, but are now practically invincible."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P3537408735" "Absorbed"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Super Reflexes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2482001105" "Super Reflexes"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2384569380" "Your Super Reflexes and acute senses allow you to react deftly to avoid danger.  Regardless of what comes at you, Super Reflexes simply allow you to avoid the attack. The type of weapon or attack used against you is irrelevant. So swords, bullets, fire, energy, even Psionic Attacks can be avoided. Super Reflexes focuses on different techniques.  Avoiding melee attacks is different than avoiding ranged attacks or even area-of-effect attacks.  Your weakness is your opponents accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focused Fighting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1051970563" "Focused Fighting"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1675020768" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Melee), Res(Confuse, DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2170083415" "You become more evasive to melee attacks while you have Focused Fighting activated. This will increase your Defense versus melee as long as it is active. Your Focus also offers you resistance to Confuse effects and DeBuffs to Defense. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2094825847" "You Focus your Fighting ability and can now easily avoid melee attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focused Senses 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2255260726" "Focused Senses"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P605775877" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Ranged), +Perception,  Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P250005807" "You become more evasive against ranged attacks while you have Focused Senses activated. This will increase your Defense versus ranged attacks as long as it is active. Your Improved Senses also allow you to perceive stealthy foes as well as resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4056646731" "You Focus your Senses and can now easily avoid ranged attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Agile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3067480205" "Agile"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2182790909" "Auto: Self +DEF(Ranged), Res(DeBuff DEF), Res(Damage, Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1481616588" "You become innately more Agile, and are able to naturally avoid some ranged attacks and resist Defense DeBuffs. Your Agility also grants you minor Damage Resistance to all damage except Toxic and Psionic.  This Damage Resistance is only available as you loose Health but it improves as your HP declines. This power is always on, and will permanently increase your Defense versus ranged attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Practiced Brawler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P964219195" "Practiced Brawler"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1060619273" "Self +Res(Knockback, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2070697174" "Your training has allowed you to become a Practiced Brawler, tuning you into a perfect fighting machine. You gain a resistance to Knockback, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilization powers for a short duration. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dodge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1353639306" "Dodge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3792980250" "Auto: Self +DEF(Melee), Res(DeBuff DEF), Res(Damage, Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4132012579" "You have the ability to innately Dodge some melee attacks and you resist Defense DeBuffs. Dodge also grants you minor Damage Resistance to all damage except Toxic and Psionic.  This Damage Resistance is only available as you loose Health but it improves as your HP declines. This power is always on, and will permanently increase your Defense versus melee attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quickness 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1103589305" "Quickness"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P644370988" "Your Quick reflexes allow you to move faster than normal, as well as resist slow effects. This power is always on and permanently increases your attack rate and movement speed."
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Evasion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2224419179" "Evasion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1039343044" "Toggle: Self +DEF(vs. AoE), Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2148336942" "You are Evasive against area effect and cone shaped attacks. This power increases your Defense versus such attacks as long as it is active. Evasion also helps you resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2600317897" "You are now extremely Evasive and can more easily Evade area of effect and cone attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elude 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1236466000" "Elude"
// Power Help Text :
"P1289164341" "You can improve your reflexes, making yourself so quick you can Elude almost any attack, be it ranged, melee, or area effect. Your running speed and jumping height and Endurance Recovery are also increased. Elude also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs. When Elude wears off, you are left drained of all Endurance and unable to Recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P4093618625" "Eluded"

