"P1223095199" "Claws"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2078289008" "Claws are bones or blades that extend from your hands and cause Lethal damage. The lightweight, natural feel of claws gives this power set a reduced Endurance cost and faster attack rate than other Stalker melee sets.  Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Claw attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Swipe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P446219949" "Swipe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2681764275" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1987112722" "Two quick Swipes with your claws. Does minor lethal damage, but has a quick recharge rate. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1026516307" "You shred {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1926929248" "{PlayerSource} Swipes you with his Claws for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4014852054" "You finish up with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1564050708" "You land a critical hit with your Claws for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// DisplayFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P174793462" "Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2492361561" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2561885389" "You perform a deadly Strike with your claws. This is a basic attack that deals a moderate amount of lethal damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2012838404" "Your {PowerName} slices {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2431068146" "{PlayerSource} Strikes you with his Claws for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P519647538" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with his Claws for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3465884966" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1099261611" "You Slash at your foe with your claws, dealing a good amount of lethal damage, but with a longer recharge rate than Swipe or Strike . This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making him easier to hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P636647227" "The claws have reduced your Defenses."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2715257919" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1588946408" "{PlayerSource} Slashes you with his Claws for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Claw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4119701065" "Assassin's Claw"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2526886418" "Melee, Special DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2523485422" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does moderate damage on its own as a frontal attack.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous lethal damage, as you impale your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power. Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2005102175" "Your {PowerName} impales {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// DisplayFloat :
"P2653320832" "ASSASSIN STRIKE"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P780343790" "{PlayerSource} impales you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of critical lethal damage!"

