// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P363396554" "Ranged, Foe Placate, Self Stealth/Hide"
// Power Help Text :
"P1766726321" "Allow you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Claw. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2734777837" "Focus"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1851910702" "Ranged, High DMG(Lethal), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1509019139" "Projects a burst of Focused power over a short distance.  Focus deals high lethal damage and can possibly knock down your foe. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eviscerate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P731777543" "Eviscerate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3380128136" "Melee (Cone), Superior DMG(Lethal), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P15596357" "You spin and slash violently, Eviscerating all foes in a wide arc in front of you.  If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical for extra lethal damage, however, there is also a very small chance you may land a Critical hit with Eviscerate, even if you are not Hidden. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4184140559" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shockwave 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2326406799" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2053598106" "Projects a Shockwave of focused power that can travel a short distance. Shockwave travels in a wide arc in front of you dealing moderate lethal damage and, possibly knocking back foes. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical for extra damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
