// Power Help Text :
"P3841240286" "Shred your opponent with several quick Swipes from your Spines. Barb Swipe deals minor lethal damage over time. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Fast"
